#MM- includes-cd: kernel-amiga-m68k-cd-includes
#MM- includes-cd_rel : kernel-amiga-m68k-cd-includes
#MM- kernel-amiga-m68k-cd : kernel-amiga-m68k-cd-includes core-linklibs linklibs-
#MM kernel-amiga-m68k-cd-linklib : kernel-amiga-m68k-cd-includes includes-
